			Noticing: {
				Rest: We can look together while I catch my breath.
				Quiet: Let's just look for a moment. No hurry.
				Soft: {
					Curious: I'm glad you showed me. What else is hiding here?
					Loyal: I like seeing what catches your eye.
					Brave: You spot the opportunity. I'll keep watch.
					Gentle: We don't have to take everything. Looking is nice, too.
					Mischievous: Good eyes. I was absolutely about to notice that.
				}
				Playful: {
					Curious: One discovery down. Several thousand to go!
					Loyal: Our very important sightseeing expedition continues.
					Brave: Excellent scouting. I'll handle the dramatic pose.
					Gentle: A tiny discovery. Those count, you know.
					Mischievous: I saw it first! ...Fine. A very close second.
				}
			}
			LookForest: A forest spot. We can shake a tree or clear fallen wood without cutting a living trunk.
			LookMineable: "{0}. I can safely mine this if you ask."
			LookProtected: "{0}. I cannot safely mine this yet, or it is protected."
		}

		Feedback: {
			Usage: /soulfeedback [open|on|off|status|flush|note|bug] [text]
			Description: Controls the local, opt-in AETHER Field Notes and bug inbox.
			Enabled: AETHER Field Notes enabled. Local files: {0}
			Disabled: AETHER Field Notes disabled. Existing local notes were kept.
			StatusOn: AETHER Field Notes are ON. Local files: {0}
			StatusOff: AETHER Field Notes are OFF. Use /soulfeedback on to opt in. Folder: {0}
			Flushed: Field Notes saved. Folder: {0}
			Error: Field Notes could not be written: {0}
			NoteDisabled: Field Notes are off. Use /soulfeedback on first.
			NoteMissing: Add a note after the command: /soulfeedback note <text>
			NoteSaved: Note added to this session.
			BugMissing: Describe the problem after the command: /soulfeedback bug <what happened>
			BugSaved: Bug report added to the local inbox with recent gameplay context.
		}

