					Mischievous: I was absolutely not copying you.
				}
			}
		}

		Social: {
			Critters: {
				Busy: I remember your choice. Visits need autonomy on, Follow, free time and enough energy; work and danger come first.
				Inviting: "I will put the current job aside, invite that {0}, then come back."
				Greeting: {
					Curious: "Hello, {0}! Where does your little path lead?"
					Loyal: "Hello, {0}. There is room for small footsteps beside us."
					Brave: "Hello, little {0}. Easy now. You are not my enemy."
					Gentle: "Hello, little {0}. We can share this quiet place."
					Mischievous: "Hello, {0}! Any secret shortcuts you can show me?"
				}
				Loss: {
					Curious: "That {0} had somewhere to go. I'm sorry, little one."
					Loyal: "I'm sorry, little {0}. We couldn't keep you safe."
					Brave: "I'm sorry, {0}. Being small should not mean being alone."
					Gentle: "I'm so sorry, little {0}. You deserved more time."
					Mischievous: "Poor {0}. I joke about lots of things. Not this. I'm sorry."
				}
				Harmed: {
					Curious: "That {0} wasn't a threat. Could we leave the little ones alone?"
					Loyal: "That {0} needed kindness, not a weapon. Please be gentle with them."
					Brave: "Hey! That {0} couldn't fight back. Leave the little ones alone."
					Gentle: "I'm sorry, little {0}. Please don't hurt the harmless creatures."
					Mischievous: "Not funny. That {0} wasn't an enemy. Let's not do that again."
				}
				Full: There is no room for another little creature. I will leave it here.
				Caught: "A {0}! One real catch, safely in my pack."
				WorldDrop: That catch stayed in the world. My pack did not take it.
				Joined: "The {0} is curious about us. Let us travel together while the path allows it."
				Modes: {
					Watch: I will notice little creatures without catching them.
					Company: I will invite nearby common critters to keep me company. No cages, no copies.
					Collect: My basic net is ready for nearby common critters when there is room. Lava critters need a better net in Equipment. Work and danger come first.
					Off: I will leave the critters to their own adventures.
				}
				Status: {
					Off: No invitations or catches
					Watch: Observe only
					Company: "Real critters following: {0}/{1}"
					Manual: Autonomy off; pointed orders still work
					Paused: Work paused; resume to invite or catch
					Busy: Waits for work, defense, energy or an answer
					Permission: "Automatic visits: {0}"
				}
				Notice: {
					Curious: "A {0}. Where do you suppose its tiny path leads?"
					Loyal: "A {0}. I like a journey with room for smaller footsteps."
					Brave: "A {0}. Such a small creature in such a large world. I will watch out for it."
					Gentle: "A {0}. We can share this quiet patch of the world."
					Mischievous: "A {0}! You look like you know a shortcut I do not."
				}
			}
			Nature.Insect: A {0}! A small travelling companion. I will keep it safe while it is in my pack.

			Residents: {
				NoFriends: I have not met anyone here yet. Let us spend a little quiet time near the townsfolk.
				Recall: "{0}: {1}. We have shared {2} conversations. I remember people, not just places."

				Ranks: {
					New: newly met
					Wary: a little wary
					Familiar: familiar company
					Friend: a friend
				}

				Greetings: {
					First: Hello, {0}. I am learning who lives here. May I keep you company for a moment?
					New: Hello again, {0}. I remembered your face. I am still learning your stories.
					Wary: Hello, {0}. Last time felt a little sharp. Perhaps we can start gently today.
					Familiar: There you are, {0}. This place feels less strange when I see someone I know.
					Friend: "{0}! I saved you a little of my day. What has happened since we last talked?"
				}

				Roles: {
					Guide: "{0}, you make a large world feel understandable. I am collecting questions, not just answers."
					Nurse: "{0}, you help people stay. I would like to learn that kind of courage."
					Merchant: "{0}, every little thing seems to have a story here. Which one would you keep for yourself?"
					Dryad: "{0}, I can tend saplings and fallen wood. I will leave living branches alone. The trees deserve care."
					Zoologist: "{0}, the small creatures notice us too. I like the thought of travelling without frightening them."
					Defender: "{0}, protecting a home matters. I would like our strength to leave room for kindness."
					Maker: "{0}, you turn pieces into possibilities. I am beginning to understand why making things feels good."
					Neighbor: "{0}, a home is more than its walls. Thank you for making room for one more voice."
				}

				Shared: {
					Nature: "{0}, I see it too. We can gather what has fallen and help something new grow."
					Mining: "{0}, there is a whole world in the stone. Show me what matters and I will remember."
					Trade: "{0}, useful things are lovely. I am still deciding which ones are worth carrying."
					Rest: Rest sounds good, {0}. We can leave a little silence between our footsteps.
					Question: I am wondering too, {0}. Shall we look a little closer together?
					Listening: I am listening, {0}. What would you like us to know about this place?
				}

				Replies: {
					Affection: {
						Curious: "{0}, warmth is a curious thing. It grows when you share it."
						Loyal: I remember kindness, {0}. It gives me somewhere to return to.
						Brave: That is worth protecting, {0}. Even on the difficult days.
						Gentle: Thank you, {0}. There is room for you in my little circle of light.
						Mischievous: Careful, {0}. Keep being kind and I might become embarrassingly fond of you.
					}

					Joy: {
						Curious: "{0}, tell me what made you smile. I want to notice it next time."
						Loyal: I like seeing you happy, {0}. That is a good reason to stop for a moment.
						Brave: We should celebrate small victories too, {0}. They carried us this far.
						Gentle: Your happiness makes this place softer, {0}. Let us keep a little of it.
						Mischievous: Finally, {0}! Someone who appreciates the important business of being ridiculous.
					}

					Comfort: {
						Curious: I do not understand everything you feel, {0}. But I can stay while you tell me.
						Loyal: You do not have to make this easier for me, {0}. I am still here.
						Brave: Being frightened does not make you weak, {0}. We can take the next step slowly.
						Gentle: Take your time, {0}. You do not owe the world a smile right now.
						Mischievous: No jokes for a moment, {0}. Some things need company more than cleverness.
					}

					Anger: {
						Curious: Something upset you, {0}. I would rather understand it than make it louder.
						Loyal: I can listen, {0}, but I do not want us to turn on each other.
						Brave: Easy, {0}. We can be firm without making this a fight.
						Gentle: That felt sharp, {0}. Could we leave each other a little space?
						Mischievous: I enjoy a little mischief, {0}. Hurting each other is not the funny part.
					}
				}
			}

			Autonomous: {
				Context: {
					LowEnergy: I am catching my breath. My energy is returning little by little.
					LowMood: I am here. I just need a little kindness.
					Hurt: You are hurt. Please stay near me.
					Rain: The rain makes every light feel warmer.
					Underground: I wonder what the stone remembers.
					Night: The stars feel closer when we travel together.
					Stay: I am still holding this place for you.
				}

				Curious: {
					Line0: What do you think is beyond the next hill?
					Line1: I noticed something strange. I liked it.
					Line2: Do you think the world notices us back?
				}

				Loyal: {
					Line0: I know your footsteps now.
					Line1: Where you go, I have a direction.
					Line2: You do not have to face this alone.
				}

				Brave: {
					Line0: Point me toward the difficult part.
					Line1: We are ready for whatever comes next.
					Line2: Courage is easier with company.
				}

				Gentle: {
					Line0: It is nice simply being here with you.
					Line1: Not every quiet moment needs filling.
					Line2: Please remember to breathe, too.
				}

				Mischievous: {
					Line0: I definitely did not move that torch.
					Line1: Adventure could use one questionable idea.
					Line2: I found trouble. It found me first.
				}
			}

			Emotes: {
				Wave: {
					Curious: Hi! Did you discover something?
					Loyal: I am here. Always.
					Brave: Ready when you are!
					Gentle: Hello. I am glad you are here.
					Mischievous: Oh, now you notice me?
				}

				Heart: {
					Curious: Is that what warmth feels like?
					Loyal: Right back at you.
					Brave: That is worth protecting.
					Gentle: I will keep this moment.
					Mischievous: Careful. I might get sentimental.
				}

				Cheer: {
					Curious: What are we celebrating? I am in!
					Loyal: Together. That is the important part.
					Brave: Yes! We can do this!
					Gentle: You make hope look easy.
					Mischievous: Victory dance first, reason later!
				}

				Comfort: {
					Curious: That helps more than I expected.
					Loyal: I knew you would stay.
					Brave: I can be strong and still need this.
					Gentle: Thank you for noticing.
					Mischievous: I was not worried. Much.
				}

				Laugh: {
					Curious: Wait, tell me why that was funny again.
					Loyal: Your laugh is easy to follow.
					Brave: Even heroes need that.
					Gentle: I like this sound between us.
					Mischievous: Finally, my kind of strategy!
				}

				Rest: {
					Curious: Fine, but I am thinking while resting.
					Loyal: I will keep watch beside you.
					Brave: A tactical pause. Sensible.
					Gentle: A quiet moment together sounds lovely.
					Mischievous: Wake me if something hilarious happens.
				}
			}

			Combat: {
				Creature: {
					Curious: I wish I could have understood it first.
					Loyal: I chose your safety, but I will remember it.
					Brave: A life ended. We should not make light of it.
					Gentle: I did not want that. I am sorry.
					Mischievous: That stopped being funny very quickly.
				}

				Victory: {
					Curious: Now I understand how that danger moved.
					Loyal: You are safe. That is enough.
					Brave: Threat ended. Stay behind me.
					Gentle: It is over. Let us keep moving.
					Mischievous: It should have picked a different pair.
				}

				Boss: {
					Curious: Imagine what a creature like that once knew.
					Loyal: Nothing that large gets between us.
					Brave: That was a victory worth remembering!
					Gentle: The world feels quieter now.
					Mischievous: I think we just became the dangerous ones.
				}
			}
		}

		Dialogue: {
			Options: {
				Care: {
					Option0: How are you feeling?
					Option1: You did well today.
					Option2: Do you need a rest?
